TITLE=E2E-87: Date-only range bounds include their whole day (#337)
TAGS=rollup
MODE=dynamo
BODY=Seed reviews across three consecutive days and call /api/analytics with date-only vs full-timestamp start_date/end_date: date-only end_date includes the whole final day (expands to T23:59:59.999Z), date-only start_date the whole first day, full timestamps pass through untouched, Postgres and DynamoDB agree, invalid dates are ignored without a 500. API inspection, no fixture PR.
